#: ../../getting_started/requirements/requirements.rst:6
msgid ""
"|morphfirst| is a software-based appliance installation capable of "
"orchestrating many clouds and hypervisors. Before an installation is "
"started it is important to understand some of the base requirements."
msgstr "O |morphfirst| é uma instalação de appliance baseada em software capaz de orquestrar muitas nuvens e hypervisors. Antes de iniciar uma instalação, é importante compreender alguns dos requisitos básicos."

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/requirements.rst:8
msgid ""
"In the simplest configuration |morpheus| needs one Appliance Server. The "
"Appliance Server, by default, contains all the components necessary to "
"orchestrate both VMs and containers. To get started some base "
"requirements are recommended:"
msgstr "Na configuração mais simples, o |morpheus| precisa de um Servidor de Appliance. O Servidor de Appliance, por padrão, contém todos os componentes necessários para orquestrar tanto VMs quanto containers. Para começar, alguns requisitos básicos são recomendados:"

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/requirements.rst:10
#: ../../getting_started/requirements/requirements.rst:173
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "Dica"

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/requirements.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Deploying on HVM?** If you are deploying |morpheus| using the HPE "
"Morpheus Manager Installer onto HVM hosts, the appliance requirements "
"below are automatically satisfied by the QCOW2 image. For HVM host "
"hardware and network requirements, see :doc:`Preparing HVM Hosts "
"</getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep>`."
msgstr "**Implantando no HVM?** Se você estiver implantando o |morpheus| usando o HPE Morpheus Manager Installer em hosts HVM, os requisitos de appliance abaixo são automaticamente atendidos pela imagem QCOW2. Para requisitos de hardware e rede de hosts HVM, consulte :doc:`Preparing HVM Hosts </getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep>`."

